        "Content": "Two bedroom end of terrace cottage dating back to circa 1840 is tucked into this historic and highly desirable enclave in the heart of Old Glasnevin. \r\nNeeding refurbishment but valued accordingly.\r\nHuge potential going forward and a substantial attic space.\r\nEligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant\r\nGas fired radiator central heating and double glazed windows and doors throughout. \r\nWithin walking distance of the National Botanic Gardens, Glasnevin Cemetery, Mobhi Road(Na Fianna GAA), Bon Secours Hospital and DCU campus."
